{"id": "45232", "title": "江山美人谱", "author": "风流龙哥", "category": "历史军事", "count": 71, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/45/45232/45232s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/45/45232.htm", "intro": "先穿三国，再穿神雕。倚天屠龙，其乐无穷。小李飞刀，香帅传说。时空穿梭，花丛游龙。     \r\n     本书公告： 同人世界，时空旅行。经典重现，绝对难忘。     \r\n     寻秦的风流，盗墓的迷情，笑傲的江湖，神雕的执着，天龙的气魄，大唐的迷恋，覆雨的癫狂，虚空的破碎……无论是金庸大师的作品，还是黄易前辈的大作，只要你们喜欢的，就有可能出现在我的笔下……", "base": "files/article/html/45/45232", "chapters": [{"title": "正文 【001】三国前言", "file": "5503106.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文 【002】时空法则", "file": "5503107.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文 【003】家有美娘", "file": "5503108.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文 【004】时空追杀", "file": "5503109.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文 【004】时空追杀", "file": "5503110.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文 【005】少女貂蝉", "file": "5503111.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文 【006】猛男张飞", "file": "5503112.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文 【007】东飞酒厂", "file": "5503113.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文 【008】淫贼刘备", "file": "5503114.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文 【009】拉拢关羽", "file": "5503115.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文 【010】郭氏为婢", "file": "5503116.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文 【011】义结金兰", "file": "5503117.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文 【012】乌龙之战", "file": "5503118.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文 【013】萝莉少女", "file": "5503119.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文 【014】琅邪于吉", "file": "5503120.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文 【015】猛男董卓", "file": "5503121.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文 【016】神棍西去", "file": "5503122.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文 【017】恶来典韦", "file": "5503123.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文 【018】收服典韦", "file": "5503124.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文 【019】早点入睡", "file": "5503125.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文 【020】刘备闹事", "file": "5503126.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文 【021】护国天师", "file": "5503127.